	)
	(text_box "HR911105A: RJ45 with 1:1 magnetics, 4 x 75R + 1 nF / 2 kV Bob Smith termination inside.\n49.9R 1 % pull-ups to the port analog supply on all four lines; both chip-side centre taps\ntie to the same supply, decoupled with 22 nF (Microchip LAN9252 schematic checklist).\nAuto-MDIX: TX and RX pairs may swap. Route each pair as 100R differential.\nGreen LED = link / activity, driven active-high by the LAN9252 (LED pin strapped low).\nShield + magnetics chassis pin: 1M || 10 nF to GND. Fit 0R for R if a hard bond is wanted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 78.74 139.7 0)
		(size 119.38 16.51)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
